# Boundary types p:dirichlet_point or dirichlet_row
E dirichlet_point 0.0
W fixed_value 0.0
N fixed_value 0.0
S fixed_value 0.0
F fixed_value -2.0
B dirichlet_point 1.0
# For dirichlet_point W,N and S are X,Y,Z coordinates for the Dirichlet point(0-based)
# For dirichlet_row W,N and S are X,Y,Z coordinates for the first Dirichlet point(0-based), B is number of points in the row and F is direction 1 - OX 2 - OY 3 - OZ
# Both B and E should indicate Boundary type